WEBVTT


00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.620
So I've been in Japan for the last several days and just got to Seoul,

00:00:05.621 --> 00:00:06.681
South Korea.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:10.660
And I have to tell you, it's an interesting change of pace

00:00:10.661 --> 00:00:12.461
after having been in Japan for some days.

00:00:12.462 --> 00:00:19.081
There are some definite differences you notice between Japan and Seoul.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.060
It's interesting. It's a lot more casual,

00:00:24.061 --> 00:00:24.861
a lot more,

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.340
I don't wanna say fun, cause I had a lot of fun in Japan,

00:00:28.341 --> 00:00:32.841
but just louder. Japan is so quiet.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:35.300
Like people are just so conservative and quiet,

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:41.001
which I got used to. But soul is just a different vibe.
